{"id":"5841c816fcbc1014","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-cooklevin.md","title":"Cook–Levin theorem","display":"thm-cooklevin — Cook–Levin theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-cooklevin","aliases":["27-thm-cooklevin"],"display":"thm-cooklevin — Cook–Levin theorem","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolexpr]]","[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-npcomplete]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.2 Theorem 2.1; Appendix B.7 Theorem B.1","source_printed_pages":"72–74, 622–624","source_pdf_pages":"96–98, 646–648","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-equivalent-formulation-proof-not-audited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-cooklevin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-cooklevin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cooklevin — Cook–Levin theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f7f08843130d6ad5\" href=\"?note=f7f08843130d6ad5\" title=\"27-df-npcomplete\">27-df-npcomplete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.2 Theorem 2.1; Appendix B.7 Theorem B.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"72–74, 622–624"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"96–98, 646–648"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-equivalent-formulation-proof-not-audited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encExpr}\">\\(\\mathrm{encExpr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPC}\">\\(\\mathbf{NPC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f7f08843130d6ad5\" href=\"?note=f7f08843130d6ad5\" title=\"27-df-npcomplete\">27-df-npcomplete</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BESAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{BESAT}\\)</span> 为下式明确定义的二进制决策语言符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BESAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encExpr}(n,E)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land E\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)(a)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BESAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encExpr}(n,E)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land E\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)(a)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BESAT}\\in\\mathbf{NPC}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BESAT}\\in\\mathbf{NPC}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书以 DNF 零方程一致性给出 Cook 定理（Theorem 2.1 / B.1）；通过补表示与标准 CNF/表达式转换得到此等价 SAT 版本。这里核对来源陈述及表示对应，未逐行重审 Appendix B.7 的机器计算表证明；不把本次定位冒充完整证明审计。修复 Eval 的元数和任意 effective injective enc 不保证多项式长度的问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-npcomplete","status":"resolved","id":"f7f08843130d6ad5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-npcomplete]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]；$\\mathrm{encExpr}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathbf{NPC}$ 见 [[27-df-npcomplete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]；$\\mathrm{encExpr}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathbf{NPC}$ 见 [[27-df-npcomplete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-npcomplete","status":"resolved","id":"f7f08843130d6ad5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]；$\\mathrm{encExpr}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathbf{NPC}$ 见 [[27-df-npcomplete]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encExpr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BESAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BESAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encExpr}(n,E)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land E\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)(a)=1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BESAT}\\in\\mathbf{NPC}.","display":true}],"bytes":1634,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-cooklevin|thm-cooklevin — Cook–Levin theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["f3101a1c9df92f67","42004383fb23d1fe","f7f08843130d6ad5"]}